Private family progress source attribution

The confctl implementation remains subject to the repository's GPL-3.0-only
LICENSE.txt. Synchronous state/rendering and Linux cursor operations are adapted
from tty-progressbar 0.18.3 and tty-cursor 0.7.1, pinned ordinary dependency bytes.
Dynamic labels are literal; unused meter/rate/elapsed work is omitted. Exact
measurement and column providers remain external injected dependencies; no
Unicode table, ANSI sanitizer or native screen implementation is copied here.

